    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A heavy silver key stamped with the gauntlet sigil of the Silver Gauntlet Tavern, hung on a braided leather fob marked <em>Suite Four</em>. It opens the tavern's four-room suite at the west end of the house — and the iron-bound treasury door that adjoins it, kept locked at all hours. Behind that door is the strongroom where Daggerford's adventurers store what they can't afford to lose.</p><p>The party's own travel chest sits inside, packed and waiting for the road.</p>",
